          "type": "heading",
          "text": {
            "en": "Beryl Retain and Allies Retain Activate"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "deck",
          "cards": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_srt4",
              "name": "Opening Found",
              "cost": 1,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 5,
                "name": "Opening Found V",
                "text": {
                  "en": "When a card of this unit is Retained, 150% Extra Attack to random enemies."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_uni1",
              "name": "Charged Shot",
              "cost": 2,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 1,
                "name": "Charged Shot I",
                "text": {
                  "en": "[Retain] 360% Damage. Retain: +180% Damage Amount."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_uni2",
              "name": "Guilty Pleasure",
              "cost": 0,
              "epiphany": {
                "level": 4,
                "name": "Guilty Pleasure IV",
                "text": {
                  "en": "Draw 1. Activate all Retain effects of cards of this unit in hand."
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1040_col",
              "name": "Daze",
              "cost": 0
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1024_uni4",
              "name": "Will of Light",
              "cost": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Beryl's Main Gimmick is \"Retaining Cards\"\nRetain cards are not discarded at the end of the turn\nRetain cards can have an activated effect that happens if they're saved\nOpening Found 5 (The Upgrade)\nONLY ACTIVATES ON END OF TURN RETAIN\nGuilty Pleasure 4, Growth Accel 1, Will of Light do not Activate it\nGuilty Pleasure 4 only affects Beryl Cards\nWill of Light only affects Orlea Cards (?)\nGrowth Accel 1 is the only version that can target allies, AKA Beryl to Combo"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
